Sat Oct 10 10:30:00 UTC 2026 - tokajer <tokajer@tokajer.at>

- First version of NazoOS Welcome (Python, PySide6, Kirigami):
  * Welcome page with disclaimer, first steps, installer button on
    the live medium, "show at login" switch
  * Drivers & codecs: NVIDIA driver (G07 open / G06 legacy) from
    NVIDIA's repository, Packman codecs like `opi codecs`
